oconv calls an object type's intersection test through int (*)(OBJREC *, CUBE *).
o_default, the test of a type with none, was declared int o_default(void): native
calling conventions ignore the extra arguments, but WebAssembly's call_indirect
checks the signature and traps. Declaring the two parameters fixes it.

